WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.680
Christians have a short word for what has
gone wrong between people and God: sin.

2
00:00:05.730 --> 00:00:09.160
Sin is anything that
goes against God's will.

3
00:00:09.210 --> 00:00:13.650
Christians believe it damages the
relationship between people and God.

4
00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:17.510
Yet they say that one death,
Jesus' death on the cross,

5
00:00:17.560 --> 00:00:18.710
deals with it.

6
00:00:18.760 --> 00:00:22.150
How can one death put
people right with God?

7
00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:25.520
In this mission, you'll read
what Jesus told Nicodemus,

8
00:00:25.570 --> 00:00:28.250
a Jewish teacher who came to him by night.

9
00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:31.630
Then you'll weigh up a
debate Christians still have:

10
00:00:31.680 --> 00:00:34.850
is faith in Jesus all a person needs?

11
00:00:34.900 --> 00:00:39.470
Your mission: find out how one
death can put people right with God.
